==Reward==
Knowledge that you've seen it all

==OOC==
This custom quest is designed to send you to every dungeon in Norrath, granting the full experience of all available lands.  It is split into 4 sections, designed for different level ranges.  The quest is most appropriate if you go through each one with a level appropriate character.  Part 1 is roughly levels 10-25, Part 2 for characters level 25-35, Part 3 for levels 35-45, and Part 4 for characters 45+.  Named targets have been selected in each zone to attempt to let you explore the majority of the space.

== Quest ==
: So, you think you know your way around Norrath, do ya?  Been there, done that and all?  We'll see, we'll see...

: Let's start you off easy.  Here are some places to get your feet a-hoppin' off to.  Prove you've really been everywhere, and defeat the guardians throughout each land.

==Part 1==
: Head on off to the continent of Faydwer, and look for the home of Clan Crushbone.  Take a good wander through their lands, though you may have to defeat a few of their leadership on the way.  From there, it's a scenic jaunt over to The Warrens, then into the gnoll lair of Blackburrow.  Once you've finished those, take an adventure down through Befallen, before, ick, frogs, in Upper Guk.  Don't go stumbling into the lower tunnels just yet!  Ya might just catch warts.  From there, collect the keys to move through Najena, before donning your best winter coat and exploring Permafrost - watch out for the Giants!  Once you've finished with those goblins, find their cousins in Runnyeye, before finishing off with an exploration of The Estate of Unrest, near where you started.  Don't miss the underground tunnels!{{CheckboxList}}
