== Part 4 ==
Oh boy, you've asked for it... the deepest and darkest parts of Norrath... and even some that aren't on Norrath!  First off, head back to Faydwer and into Kedge Keep, to find the room of that fishy wizard.  Next, head back into Nagafen's Lair... and I mean the lair itself this time!  Try not to get too cooked.  If you need to cool off, head over to Permafrost and find Lady Vox's lair hidden within.  Lastly on this world, head deep into the hole and explore its depths!  From there, you can head into the Planes of Fear and Hate, then finish up with some island time in the Plane of Sky!{{CheckboxList}}
